            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "ふふふふふ！　我ながら完璧な作戦なのだ♪\nさあ、ワルたちのいるビリヤード場に乗り込んで――",
            "enText": "Muhahaha! I don't wanna brag, this is a perfect plan ♪ \nNow I just need to pop into their hideout in the billiard room…",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 280,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
