            "pathId": 8320579091504418014,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "もう隊長ではありませんよ。\nそれよりも今、ビリヤード場に乗り込むと聞こえたような――",
            "enText": "I'm not your captain anymore, remember? \nThough… I may be mistaken, but did I hear you mention \ngoing to the billiard room?",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 215,
            "voiceIdx": 24,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": 7316242693784935402
                },
